---
import AccountLayout from "../components/AccountLayout.astro";
---
<AccountLayout title="登录">
  <section class="account-card account-login">
    <h1 data-login-title>登录工作区</h1>
    <p data-login-hint>使用管理员分配的账号登录。会话仅对本人可见。</p>
    <form data-login-form>
      <fieldset disabled data-login-fields>
        <label>账号<input name="account" autocomplete="username" required maxlength="64" pattern="[a-zA-Z0-9][a-zA-Z0-9_.\-]{0,63}" /></label>
        <label>密码<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required minlength="8" maxlength="128" /></label>
        <label data-confirmation hidden>确认管理员密码<input name="confirmation" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" maxlength="128" /></label>
        <button type="submit" class="account-primary" data-login-submit>登录</button>
      </fieldset>
    </form>
    <small>工作区由管理员分配，普通用户不能自行添加。仅提供应用权限隔离，不提供终端沙箱。</small>
  </section>
</AccountLayout>
<script>import "../accounts/login-page";</script>
